BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opening Reception for “The Ashokawna Watershed Atlas Projects”
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260422T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260422T183000
UID:260412IWP64sminU-U0m9_SamaVQ
DESCRIPTION:Harmon Guest House hosts an opening reception for *The Ashok
 awna Watershed Atlas Projects*\, a new series of installations by local a
 rtist Linus Lancaster and Healdsburg High School students. The exhibit
 ion features hand-built ceramics\, watercolor\, and sculptural works creat
 ed from locally sourced clays that reflect the diverse landscapes of the R
 ussian River Watershed. Guests will have the opportunity to meet the arti
 st and enjoy curated seasonal bites and refreshment while exploring the 
 exhibition.  \n\nThe installations\, part of the hotel’s rotating art
  program\, will be on view from April 22 through May 21\, 2026 in the
  hotel lobby. The opening reception is complimentary for all attendees\
 , and no RSVP is required. Pets and children are welcome.
LOCATION:Harmon Guest House hotel lobby
URL:https://harmonguesthouse.com/hotel/art-installations/linus-lancaster/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
