SUMMARY:The Letting Go Art Experience ✨ (No Art Experience Needed)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260422T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260422T203000
UID:260419GIVnaPq8vk2niX809OPtGg
DESCRIPTION:There’s a part of you that doesn’t get much space in every
 day life. The part that wants to slow down… to create… to feel without
  needing to explain anything. This is a space for that. The Letting Go Art
  Experience is a guided\, immersive session where art becomes a tool for r
 elease\, expression\, and reconnection. This is not an art class. There’
 s nothing to get right. Nothing to prove. No experience needed. Just a cha
 nce to step out of your head and into a more intuitive\, honest space. Wha
 t to expect: We’ll move through a gentle\, intentional flow: Grounding \
 \+ breathwork to arrive in your body Guided prompts to quiet the inner cri
 tic Free\, intuitive art-making \\(large-scale\, expressive\, no pressure\
 \) Music\, movement\, and space to explore Optional sharing circle to refl
 ect \\(no critique\, ever\\) This is for you if… You’ve been feeling s
 tuck\, overwhelmed\, or disconnected You miss being creative but don’t k
 now where to start You’re craving time that’s just for you You want to
  release something you’ve been holding onto
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2723961641305278/?acontext=%7B%22event
