DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate community\, the outdoors\, and 80 years of West
 minster Woods on Saturday\, April 25th\, 2026\, from 12–6 pm. Set beneat
 h our incredible redwoods\, Day at The Woods has something for everyone. E
 xpect a Sherwood Forest–themed faire \\(iykyk\\)\, access to our hiking 
 trails\, crafts\, and classic camp games. Live music will fill the forest 
 throughout the day with local bands including Late for the Train\, Scott E
 lliot Ferreter\, and Frognbog. Food trucks will be on site\, along with be
 er and wine served by Old Caz and Pax Wines\, plus the option to add on ou
 r Zipline Challenge Course.\n\nDay at The Woods is an invitation to slow d
 own and reconnect with each other\, with nature\, and with the community t
 hat has carried this place forward for nearly 80 years. Proceeds support W
 estminster Woods’ mission and programs\, including Outdoor Education for
  youth across Northern California\, Summer Camps\, and transformative retr
 eats for all ages.\n\nFor more information visit westminsterwoods.org/datw
 .
LOCATION:Westminster Woods
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108174403?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
