UID:260412uB-QNvkVfU63O7KhrfU3yw
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us and 25+ wineries per day for Passpo
 rt to Dry Creek Valley\, California’s Friendliest Wine + Food Festival!
  Travel throughout 16 X 2 idyllic miles and enjoy sun-soaked vineyards
 \, laughter amongst friends\, and unforgettable experiences in world-
 class wine\, food\, and musical entertainment!\n\nSingle-day passes ava
 ilable for a taste of the magic as well as weekend passes to soak
  it all in! Meet founders & winemakers\, taste award-winning wines 
 and hyper-local foodie bites\, and enjoy live music and DJ beats! Plus
 \, full access to insider perks all weekend long.\n\nThe perfect blend of 
 tradition and innovation\, Dry Creek Valley is where serious wine is craft
 ed in a delightfully relaxed environment. It honors the legendary families
  who have been here for generations\, and is as much about the community a
 s it is about the land and the wine.\n\nYou’re supporting the legacy of 
 Dry Creek Valley's agriculture\, story and our non-profit organization –
  celebrating the valley\, its wineries\, farmers\, grape growers and commu
 nity!\n\nExperience soil to sip – taste the land. Looks good in the glas
 s. Even better when you taste it.\n\nWhether it’s your first year or one
  of many\, there is an immense amount to discover — and rediscover!
LOCATION:Dry Creek Valley AVA
URL:https://www.drycreekvalley.org/dcv-passport/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
