DESCRIPTION:It's the BEST day of the year and a party all across the count
 ry... And YOU are invited! Come celebrate Independent Bookstore Day with u
 s on Saturday\, April 25th 9 am - 5pm! There will be exclusive merchandise
  including totes\, signed books\, limited edition Blackwing pencils\\(!!!\
 \)\, raffles\, stickers\, freebies\, story time\, a libro.fm golden ticket
  hunt\, cake\, treats\, and more. It's the most fun way to show indies lik
 e us some love\, and we love that love! Independent Bookstore Day \\(Indie
  Bookstore Day\\) was established in 2013 to promote\, celebrate\, and hig
 hlight the value of the Independent bookstore community. The day has been 
 observed on the last Saturday of April every year since 2013. This year th
 ere are over 1\,200 stores participating across the country\, including us
  and our local pals Bookshop Benicia\, Napa Bookmine\, and Fair Arrow... C
 ome visit all of us! And this year it's a double whammy -- it's also the d
 owntown Earth Daze festival\, filled with activities and fun \\(https://ww
 w.theeverwonder.org/earthdaze1\\)\, and we're a passport stop! It's the pe
 rfect day to come downtown! Hooray for indie bookstores! Hooray for Indepe
 ndent Bookstore Day! Hooray for Earth Daze! Hooray for downtown Vallejo! S
 ee you on the 25th!
LOCATION:Alibi Bookshop
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/4576609399229180/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
