UID:260419-BqUqfdPYkSnS4ANghIN0w
DESCRIPTION:Explore Jordan's 1\,200-acre estate during Jordan Winery's gui
 ded  Earth Week Nature Hike on April 24th and 25th. The journey begins in 
 Bacchus Courtyard with breakfast bites by Executive Chef Jesse Mallgren\, 
 followed by a three-mile hike through private trails with scenic hills and
  valleys. After the hike\, enjoy a seated wine-paired lunch on the Jordan 
 Terrace\, featuring seasonal\, locally sourced ingredients and estate-grow
 n produce. The experience includes current releases of Jordan Russian Rive
 r Chardonnay and Alexander Valley Cabernet Sauvignon. This immersive outin
 g blends nature\, culinary excellence\, and wine for a memorable spring ex
 perience.
