UID:260421HHcLXpj4WESyRfpiVX2FiQ
DESCRIPTION:***We The Sculptors…***From ancient monuments carved in ston
 e to bold contemporary abstraction\, sculpture has always been a defiant p
 resence in the world. It occupies space and refuses to be ignored.\n\nTen 
 Sonoma County sculptors will gather at the T Barny Gallery and Sculpture G
 ardens on April 25 & 26 from 11 AM to 4 PM to celebrate International Scul
 pture Days with an event titled *We The Sculptors*. (https://sculpture.org
 /page/isday ) Their works range from Ceramics to Stone\, and Steel to Zip 
 Ties.\n\nJoin us in the gardens for a free weekend of art that speaks\, re
 sists\, and invites you to do the same.\n\nCome stand with us and join the
  conversation. Come make a little\, very good trouble of your own - Defian
 t Dissidence\n\n**For more information\, please contact Wendy Dayton manag
 er@tbarny.com\,**\n\n**707-431-8378**
LOCATION:T Barny Gallery & Sculpture Garden
