BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mercy Presents: Craft & Chill 4/26/26
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T150000
UID:260413kmit23JzkkWqZW0KJS0QOQ
DESCRIPTION:Let your creativity burn bright and your style get a little…
  higher. Join us inside The Lounge at Mercy for a hands-on afternoon of cr
 afting\, chill vibes\, and good company. Bring a friend\, spark your imagi
 nation\, and make something uniquely you — just be sure to grab your tic
 ket to save your spot!\n\nThis month’s Craft & Chill is all about creati
 ng your very own custom ashtray. We’ll have a variety of bedazzling supp
 lies\, and charms so you can design a place for your joints that's totall
 y one-of-a-kind. Whether you go bold\, sparkly\, artsy\, or just a little 
 extra\, there’s no wrong way to make your masterpiece.\n\nSo roll up you
 r sleeves\, add a little sparkle\, and let the creativity flow. By the end
  of the afternoon\, you’ll leave with a custom ashtray that’s lit\, le
 git\, and totally you.\n\nSpots are limited — snag your ticket and come 
 craft\, chill\, and top off your look.\n\nBrought to you by PAX.\n\nDate &
  Time\n\nDate: Sunday\, April 26\, 2026\n\nTime: 12:00 - 3:00 PM\n\nWhat
 ’s Included\n\nAll craft supplies\n\nGood vibes\n\nA cannabis-friendly l
 ounge to spark your creativity\n\nTicket Tiers\n\n$15 - EARLY BIRD GA: Cra
 ft An Ashtray- Includes the full Craft & Chill experience where you’ll d
 esign and bedazzle your own ashtray. All supplies provided. Early bird pri
 cing until March 31st!\n\n$20 - General Admission: Craft An Ashtray- Inclu
 des the Craft & Chill session where you’ll customize and bedazzle your o
 wn ashtray. All materials and supplies included.\n\n$25 - Craft An Ashtray
  \\+ Sesh Starter \\(Joint\\) - Craft your own bedazzled ashtray and enjoy
  a 1g preroll to kick off your sesh while you create.\n\n$30 - Craft An As
 htray \\+ Sesh Starter \\(Extract\\) - Includes the ashtray crafting exper
 ience plus one concentrate for guests who want a stronger lift while they 
 craft and chill.\n\n$30 - Craft An Ashtray \\+ Sesh Starter \\(Flower\\) -
  Craft your ashtray and enjoy 1g of flower to elevate the creative session
 .\n\n$30 - Craft An Ashtray \\+ Sesh Starter \\(Vape\\) - Includes the ash
 tray crafting session plus an all-in-one vape to enjoy during the event.\n
 \n$45 - Craft An Ashtray \\+ Flower Flight - Includes the ashtray crafting
  session plus a 3-gram flower tasting flight \\(three 1g selections\\) to 
 explore while you craft and chill.\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://www.themercylounge.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
