DESCRIPTION:Experience an afternoon of unforgettable live music\, food\, d
 rink\, art & more at the historic Mare Island on Officer's Row. Experience
  an afternoon of unforgettable live music at the historic Mare Island on O
 fficer's Row \\(Walnut Avenue\\). Decked Out at The Quarters brings togeth
 er Bay Area's unique and talented acts for a one-day-only music extravagan
 za you won't want to miss. With over 20 bands rocking genres from jazz and
  folk to R&B and rock\, Decked Out at The Quarters will be pulsing with th
 e sounds of local talent. Beyond the beats\, you'll meet local artists\, f
 ace painters\, delicious bites from lots of great local food vendors\, and
  plenty of cold beverages and more. Bring your crew and your furry friends
  - this event is about coming together and celebrating community through g
 reat music. Small lawn chairs\, lawn blankets are welcome. Bikes and well-
 behaved family pets are allowed to partake. We will have a secured Bike Pa
 rking corral\, thanks to our friends at the Napa County Bicycle Coalition.
  To learn more about Mare Island\, consider downloading the Mare Island Na
 vigator App. Details here: EXPLORE MARE ISLAND. THE 2026 LINE-UP Alvon Joh
 nson \\* Arrinae Del \\* Bautista \\* Birds of a Feather \\* Blue Static \
 \* The Breedloves \\* Canyon \\* Chris Cole \\* Craig Corona \\* Dave & th
