UID:260419gKulEjpLy0uuRN4mi_2Z9A
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 35th anniversary of Passport to Dry Creek Valley
 \, a beloved spring wine and food weekend featuring 50\\+ wineries from Ap
 ril 24-26. This immersive experience invites guests to explore the valley 
 while tasting award-winning wines\, enjoying thoughtfully paired local bit
 es\, and connecting with winemakers and founders. Live music\, exclusive p
 erks\, and scenic vineyard settings create a lively and memorable atmosphe
 re throughout the weekend. Guests can sip\, stroll\, and discover the uniq
 ue character of Dry Creek Valley at their own pace. More than just a ticke
 t\, this event supports the region's agricultural heritage\, local farmers
 \, grape growers\, and the community that makes it all possible. Join fell
 ow wine lovers for a fun-filled celebration of wine\, food\, and the spiri
 t of Dry Creek Valley.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/passport-to-dry-creek-valley-weekend/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
