 onors of Russian River LGBTQ\\+ Pride.\n\nLocated at the beautiful Highlan
 d Dell Lodge. Attendees will enjoy a cocktail hour \\(cash bar\\) with pas
 sed hors d'oeuvres\, followed by a buffet dinner with salads\, a main entr
 ee \\(vegetarian option\\)\, sides\, and dessert. Wine is included with di
 nner.\n\nThe Russian River Pride Board of Directors are pleased to present
  $25\,000 in awards to eight worthwhile West Sonoma County non-profits who
  support our community every day: Hugs Grief Group\, Monte Rio Chamber of 
 Commerce\, Solar Punk Farms\, Ruthless Kindness\, Friends of Monte Rio\, R
 ussian River Youth Center\, Russian River Keeper\, and the Russian River C
 hamber of Commerce and Visitor Center.
