SUMMARY:Kabbalah & Coffee
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T113000
UID:260414peNvhf1USEmptL_ZG5rhsw
DESCRIPTION:Kabbalah & Coffee ☕☕\n\nMidnight. After 210 years of slave
 ry in Egypt\, Pharaoh finally caved after 10 plagues\, and the Jews were a
 ble to leave. Immediately\, they started counting down 49 days\, until the
  moment they were to stand at the foot of Mount Sinai to receive the Torah
 .\n\nWhat does this 49-day journey through the desert represent? Join us a
 s we explore the mystical 7-step self-exploration transformative process t
 hat prepared the Jews to become the Chosen Nation.\n\n3 Tuesday mornings A
 pril 14th\, 21st\, and 28th - 11:30am
LOCATION:Peet's Coffee
URL:https://www.jewishpetaluma.com/templates/articlecco_cdo/aid/6866303/je
 wish/Kabbalah-Coffee.htm
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The World of Kabbalah begins April 21
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T193000
UID:2604149epLX3ro2kaSPkteuOkbYg
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever been curious about Kabbalah\, but unsure what it
  really is?\n\nChabad of Novato invites the community to join a new six-we
 ek course: The World of Kabbalah.\n\nThis engaging course will explore Ju
 daism’s deeper mystical teachings in a clear\, thoughtful\, and practica
 l way\, offering insight into the soul\, purpose\, inner growth\, and the 
 deeper meaning of life.\n\nClasses will be held on Tuesdays at 7:30 PM o
 n April 21\, 28\, May 12\, 19\, 26\, and June 2.\n\nThe course is open to
  both in-person and online participants. In-person classes will take plac
 e at Chabad of Novato\, 695 De Long Ave\, Novato. A Zoom option is avai
