 ng pirates\, crossed blades with sword-wielding knights\, and circumnaviga
 ted the moon in a cardboard box...all before the age of eight. Now that sh
 e's earned a Bachelor of Arts\, lived on two continents\, and raised four 
 kids \\(humans\, not goats\\)\, Donna writes books for children based on h
 er childhood adventures laced with her actual life experiences-dogsledding
  in the arctic is one. She lives in Northern California with her husband a
 nd a rambunctious Labrador Retriever. Join us for book reading of her late
 st picture book\, There Are No Dragons in this Book!
