 ress… and you’re invited inside. Bay Area Stage Theatre proudly presen
 ts MISERY\, the nerve-shredding thriller that will have you gripping your 
 seat and laughing through the terror. When famous novelist Paul Sheldon is
  rescued from a devastating car crash by his “number one fan\,” Annie 
 Wilkes\, he thinks he’s been given a second chance at life. But Annie ha
 s plans of her own—and she’ll stop at nothing to get the ending she wa
 nts. What follows is a deliciously twisted game of cat-and-mouse filled wi
 th dark humor\, shocking turns\, and edge-of-your-seat suspense. As Annie
 ’s cheerful façade cracks\, Paul realizes that escape may come at a ter
 rifying cost. This electrifying stage adaptation brings Stephen King’s l
 egendary psychological thriller to life in an intimate theatrical experien
 ce that will leave you breathless. Don’t miss the show audiences call 
 “diabolically entertaining.” Opening Night: May 1\, 2026 Bay Area Stag
 e Theatre Fridays & Saturdays at 8:00 PM Sundays at 3:00 PM Runs through M
 ay 17\, 2026 Seats are limited—and Annie is waiting. TICKETS: www.bayare
 astage.org Reserve your tickets now. If you’re her number one fan… you
  won’t want to miss it.
