 t-after happiness expert speaking at conferences and workplaces around the
  world\, guiding audiences toward more fulfilling lives using research fro
 m positive psychology. By night\, he’s a high-energy comedian\, emcee\, 
 and improv performer bringing big laughs through Humor.us Productions. He 
 may be one of the happiest comedians you’ll ever meet—but that doesn
 ’t mean life goes perfectly. From awkward misunderstandings to unforgett
 able mishaps\, Anthony shares the hilarious \\(and very human\\) stories t
 hat prove joy isn’t about perfection—it’s about perspective. Come re
 ady to laugh\, learn\, and leave a little lighter. Connect with him on Lin
 kedIn\, Instagram on Only Fans. Tickets $20 in advance\, $25 at the door. 
