BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Brandlin Estate Wine & Food Tasting Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T160000
UID:260312Tyymcsdi90Gq73eWIOnINQ
DESCRIPTION:Born on the rugged slopes of Mount Veeder\, Brandlin Estate pr
 oduces wines of structure\, intensity\, and place. The Brandlin Experience
  offers an in-depth exploration of this historic vineyard site through a c
 urated tasting of five estate-grown wines—including Zinfandel from centu
 ry-old vines and the estate’s signature Cabernet Sauvignon. This seated\
 , guided experience invites guests to delve into the mountain terroir thro
 ugh the lens of small-lot winemaking. Each wine reflects the elevation\, e
 xposure\, and rocky soils that define the Brandlin Estate. For an added di
 mension\, guests may opt to include seasonal bites\, thoughtfully paired t
 o complement the structure and complexity of the wines. This experience is
  hosted at the picturesque Boathouse.
LOCATION:Brandlin Estate 
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brand
 lin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Full Moon Paddle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T213000
UID:260306jboWNSyrWkaSwVnJE6BcjQ
DESCRIPTION:Come play on the river at night.\n\nJoin The Floathouse for a 
 magical evening paddle on the Petaluma River—Petaluma’s Longest Park
 —timed to catch the full moon rising over the wetlands just south of dow
 ntown. As twilight fades\, we’ll head out together in Hobie pedal kayaks
  for a relaxed\, guided glide that turns nighttime into playtime.\n\nThese
  pedal-powered kayaks make the journey smooth and easy\, even if there’s
  a breeze or moving tide. We’ll cruise about a mile and a half downriver
  to the perfect moonrise vantage point\, where calm water\, wide skies\, a
 nd glowing reflections set the scene.\n\nThis is a social\, feel-good outd
 oor experience designed for anyone looking for something a little differen
 t to do after dark—part nature\, part adventure\, part pure vibe.\n\n$60
  per person includes everything: • Hobie pedal kayak • PFD and safety 
 lights • Experienced local guide • A memorable\, moonlit river experie
 nce\n\n✨ Easy. Playful. Peaceful. Spend your evening under the full moon
 —on the water.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/petaluma-river-full-moo
 n-paddle/17974383/2026-05-01T19
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
