DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T000000
UID:260416sJz0SgdM0U2YRXrtvQKTgw
DESCRIPTION:THE TAHOES RETURN TO BREWSTERS PETALUMA 🔥\n\nThey're Back a
 nd Ready to Blow the Roof Off Again!\n\nPETALUMA – BRACE YOURSELVES\n\nT
 he wait is over! Sonoma County's most explosive rock/funk/punk/reggae powe
 rhouse is making their triumphant return to the legendary Brewsters\, and 
 this time they're bringing even MORE fire to the stage!\n\n⚡ THE COMEBAC
 K YOU'VE BEEN WAITING FOR ⚡\n\nAfter leaving Brewsters scorched the last
  time around\, The Tahoes are back to prove lightning DOES strike twice. I
 f you caught the first show\, you know what's coming. If you missed it –
  this is your chance to see what all the hype is about.\n\n🎸 12 YEARS. 
 COUNTLESS STAGES. ONE LEGENDARY VENUE. 🎸\n\nFrom opening for icons like
  Sublime with Rome\, 311\, The Wailers\, and Fishbone to destroying stages
  at DNA Lounge\, Bottom of the Hill\, and the High Times Cannabis Cup – 
 The Tahoes have proven they belong among the West Coast's elite live acts.
 \n\nNOW THEY'RE BRINGING IT ALL HOME TO BREWSTERS\n\nExpect:\n\n✓ High-o
 ctane originals that hit like a freight train\n\n✓ Crowd favorites that'
 ll have the whole room moving\n\n✓ That signature Tahoes energy that kee
 ps the party going all night long\n\n✓ A show you'll be talking about fo
 r weeks\n\n🌟 THIS IS THE SHOW BREWSTERS HAS BEEN WAITING FOR 🌟\n\nMa
 rk your calendars. Clear your schedule. Tell your friends. The Tahoes are 
 coming back to Brewsters\, and it's going to be LEGENDARY.\n\nSEE YOU AT B
 REWSTERS – LET'S MAKE SOME NOISE! 🎶🍻
LOCATION:Brewsters Beer Garden
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107930483?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
