  7:00am to 9:30am\n\nJudging: 10:00am-1:00pm\n\nPublic Viewing of Winners 
 & Rose Sale: 1:00pm-4:00pm\n\nStay and join us for a special Rose Sale fro
 m 1–4 PM. Our member partners\, Russian River Rose Co. and Alexander Nur
