BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garagiste Wine Festival: 8th Annual Northern Exposure
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T170000
UID:260218hd8uOBSrNUiwab6Do7VVIA
DESCRIPTION:The 8th Annual Garagiste Festival: Northern Exposure is coming
  back on May 2\, 2026 to give you rare access to the region's best small\,
  hard-to-find winemakers. At this intimate event\, you will discover and t
 aste amazing\, cutting edge wines from over 40 high-quality\, micro-produc
 tion\, commercial wineries from Napa\, Sonoma\, Mendocino\, Sierra Foothil
 ls\, and more.\n\nFind out for yourself why we’ve been selling out our e
 vents for ten years and why we were named the #1 Wine Festival in the Coun
 try by USA Today! Meet the winemakers and hear directly from them about th
 e ins and outs of their winemaking styles.\n\nOver 90% of Garagiste wineri
 es do not have a tasting room\, so this is truly a singular chance to disc
 over and meet the next great winemakers and get the opportunity to taste t
 heir amazing micro-production wines. Your appointment to try these wines 
 is all in one room\, right here! You won't be able to duplicate this tasti
 ng experience at any other wine event.  \n\nMeet the winemakers\, taste 
 their passion!\n\n**2026 Winemaker Participants include:** Amalgam Wines\
 , Burning Bench Cellars\, Carpenter Wine\, Cazadero Winery\, Chaney Family
  Winery\, Cormorant Cellars\, Crosby Roamann\, Flora Ranch Co.\, Forgotten
  Union Wines\, G & C Lurton Estate\, Gothic Noir Wine\, Greyscale Wines\, 
 Jambe de Bois Wines Kendric Vineyards\, Krueger Vaught\, Lussier Wine Co.\
 , Maybach Family Cellars\, McCarter Cellars\, Mersenne Wines\, Mon Premier
  Wines\, Oceano Wines\, Oxlee Graham Wines\, Panther Ridge Vineyards\, Pin
 e Mountain Vineyards\, Puccioni Vineyards\, Rock & Clay Wines\, Shick Fami
 ly Wines\, Spur Road Wines\, Staysail Cellars\, and Y.B. Wine Co.\n\n **G
 RAND TASTING: 2:00-5:00pm - Includes unlimited tasting with over 30 small 
 lot winemakers\, complimentary cheese\, bread and charcuterie\, as well as
  samples from local artisan vendors.**\n\n**RARE & RESERVE EARLY ACCESS: 1
 :00-5:00pm**  \n\n**Entry an hour early at 1:00pm and enjoy access to Rar
 e & Reserve wines only being poured during this hour. Limited tickets avai
 lable to create a less crowded experience. Only 150 Tickets are available
  to this session.**
LOCATION:Sonoma Veterans Memorial Hall
URL:https://www.garagistefestival.com/sonoma-may-2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
