 n the sun listening to great music\, or a romantic afternoon sipping on yo
 ur favorite wine and dancing\, this band has got you covered.  Food: Delic
 ious Dishez will be serving up Cajun Cuisine: southern fried chicken\, fri
 ed fish\, shrimp\, fresh hand cut chicken tenders\, sticky icky wings\, go
 urmet Mac n cheese\, collard greens\, seasoned fries\, and hush puppies! M
 isc: Gate opens at noon. Minors welcome\, kids 12 and under are free. Well
