 ry Terminal parking lot \\(150 Georgia St.\, Vallejo\, CA\\).  Hosted by t
 he Solano Fire Safe Council\, this family-friendly event offers a great op
 portunity to learn how to protect your home and loved ones from wildfires 
 while enjoying activities for all ages.  Attendees can explore emergency v
 ehicles\, watch live demonstrations\, meet first responders and community 
 organizations\, and enjoy food trucks and raffle prizes. Come for the fun 
 and leave with a plan to stay safe and prepared!
