 sland Immigration Station Foundation\, Angel Island State Park\, Marin His
 tory Museum\, the National Estuarine Research Reserve\, and more.\n\nGuest
 s can also enjoy a special historic walking tour of the village led by Mil
 ton Quan\, one of the last residents of China Camp Village—an experience
