 3\, 2026\, at the Fairmont Sonoma Mission Inn & Spa for an intimate\, thou
 ghtfully curated literary experience. Designed to “stimulate the minds a
 nd nurture the souls of readers\,” the exclusive three-day event brings 
 together more than 20 celebrated authors\, speakers\, and moderators—inc
 luding Dave Barry\, Doris Kearns Goodwin\, Andrew Ross Sorkin\, Maria Semp
 le\, Admiral James Stavridis and more.
LOCATION:Fairmont Sonoma Mission Inn\, Sonoma\, CA
URL:https://svauthorsfest.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
