UID:260326UAHIngtmpUu62P9prU2zXQ
DESCRIPTION:Give your dogs \\(and family\\) a rockin’ day to remember at
  WOOFSTOCK!\n\nGrab your leash\, furry friends\, and family to join us for
  the Bay Area’s grooviest dog \\(and animal\\) lover’s event! Enjoy mu
 sic by Pop Fiction\, Corte Madera Town Band\, and other local legends!\n\n
 Food trucks featuring vegetarian food\, beer\, and wine available and the 
 ever-popular free Kid’s Zone will be back with awesome activities for ki
 ds of all ages. Explore event booths featuring local merchants and animal 
 rescue groups! All proceeds benefit the animals at Marin Humane.\n\nGuests
  are encouraged to bring lawn chairs and blankets to watch the show. Don
 ’t forget to BYOWB \\(Bring Your Own Water Bottle\\) as there will be pu
