 ou sing often or haven't sung before\, this circle is for everyone. ✨ Ev
 ent Details: When: First Thursday of each month\, 6:00-7:30 PM Where: The 
 Social Hall @ Center for Spiritual Living Santa Rosa 2075 Occidental Road\
 , Santa Rosa\, CA 95401 Who: Family-friendly and open to all skill levels 
