BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spring Open House at The Reverie Salon Napa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T200000
UID:260421ZGeK3UK_hUKpzKsb0hZE5w
DESCRIPTION:The Reverie Salon Napa invites you to celebrate a new chapter 
 with a Spring Open House on Friday\, May 8\, 2026\, from 5:00 to 8:00 PM. 
 Founder Seanna Murray and new owner Sallie Ramsey welcome the Napa Valley 
 community to toast this exciting transition at one of the area's most belo
 ved wellness-inspired salons. The evening promises festive atmosphere\, gi
 fts from Kérastase and local women-owned businesses\, and exclusive premi
 um Kérastase bundles available for purchase — just in time for Mother's
  Day gifting.  This gathering carries a meaningful philanthropic thread: a
  portion of proceeds from sales will be donated to Soroptimist Internation
 al of Napa\, an organization that funds grants helping local women and gir
 ls access education and training toward economic empowerment. It's an even
 ing where beauty\, community\, and purpose come beautifully together in th
 e heart of Napa Valley.  The event is free and open to all. Come as you ar
 e\, connect with the community\, and celebrate the spirit of spring and ne
 w beginnings.
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/spring-open-house-at-the-reverie-sal
 on-napa/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Uncorked for a Cause with Wiley's Wish and Mutt Lynch Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T190000
UID:260417JT0dWH5WRUCUH4z3nqe1bg
DESCRIPTION:We’re putting together something really special — and it
 ’s all for the dogs 🤍\n\nWiley’s Wish\, Mutt Lynch Winery\, and Dog
  Moms of Sonoma County are coming together for a fundraiser \\+ silent au
 ction we’re so excited about — Uncorked for a Cause.\n\nSave the dat
 e: May 8th from 4–7pm\n\nThis night is all about raising funds to contin
 ue the work behind Wiley’s Wish — rescuing\, training\, and showing up
  every day for dogs who need a second chance.\n\nWe’re curating a really
  fun\, thoughtful silent auction \\(with some good surprises coming 👀
 \\)\, and every bid goes directly back to supporting the dogs in our care.
 \n\nAnd of course — there will be wine 🍷\, and some of our incredible
  trained rescue dogs there to meet \\(the real stars of the show\\).\n\nIt
 ’s an easy\, feel-good way to spend an evening while being part of somet
 hing that truly matters. Join us!
LOCATION:Mutt Lynch Winery
URL:https://wileyswish.com/pages/news-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
