BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FLAMENCO! LIVE! Saturday\, May 10th 2025 at The Big Easy Mother's 
 Day Show!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T200000
UID:260420maSfMqXlGEG7AvAgl0JIUw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an intoxicating evening of fiery flamenco performa
 nces when FLAMENCO! LIVE! sets the stage on fire with the fury and passion
  of Spain's legendary Gypsies \\(Roma\\) with a Flamenco Dinner Show in th
 e intimate atmosphere of THE BIG EASY. EXPERIENCE flamenco as stirring dan
 ces\, blazing guitars\, and soulful singing will transport you to another 
 place and time. FEEL the HEAT...\n\nFLAMENCO! LIVE! SPECIAL MOTHER'S DAY S
 HOW\n\nSaturday\, May 9th 2026\n\nClaudia Barros ~ Dancer Christina Zanfag
 na ~ Dancer Azriel "El Moreno" ~ Singer "La Fibi" ~ Singer Ricardo Diaz ~ 
 Guitarist\n\nShowtime: 6 pm Doors: 5 pm $30 Pay at the Door Cash or Card\n
 \nat The Big Easy Club and Restaurant 128 American Alley Petaluma USA\n\n\
 \*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Flamenco Shows every OTHER Month! The 2nd Saturda
 y of the Month. Always different Artists. Always a different Show.\n\nFlam
 enco Dinner Show with delicious food and a Full Bar are available\, not in
 cluded in entrance fee.\n\nArrive early\, get a good table and enjoy the f
 ood! Line forms at 4:45 pm\n\n\\*Limited Reservations available for partie
 s of 5 - 6 or more. Call at: \\(707\\) 774- 9072\n\n\\*Large fully ventila
 ted restaurant\, plenty of room for spacing\, masks optional.\n\nFLAMENCO!
  LIVE! ﻿was envisioned\, conceived\, and has thrived since 2002 in Sonom
 a County\, California\, now celebrating 24 years! Presenting the collabora
 tive efforts of the Bay Area's finest Flamenco Singers\, Guitarists and Da
 ncers\, and supporting local Flamenco students\, dreamers\, and talents\, 
 our goal has been to present top-notch performances. Phoebe Vernier "La Fi
 bi" has brought decades of artistry and energy to the public of Sonoma Cou
 nty for the purpose of sharing the music\, song and dance\, the treasure o
 f Southern Spain. Whether in the formal theater or in a casual setting\, t
 he respect\, purity\, and integrity of this traditional\, yet living and e
 volving art form is always foremost.\n\nNow in our 4rd Year of romantic Fl
 amenco Shows!\n\nThis performance is underwritten by the generous support 
 of "The Circle of Sponsors"\, a group of flamenco music\, song and dance A
 ficionados from Sonoma County\, California and Nationwide that believe in 
 the power of local art to heal and inspire our community and world. Thank 
 you so much\, Sponsors!\n\n"Best Performing Dance Company" - The Northbay 
 Bohemian's BEST of the Northbay!
LOCATION:The Big Easy Club and Restaurant
URL:https://flamencolive.weebly.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
