 llejo\, 94591 Route: ~1 mile walk Who: Everyone is welcome — bring your 
 walking shoes\, your support\, and your positivity! Why join? ✨ Raise aw
 areness about mental health and reduce stigma ✨ Walk in solidarity with 
 individuals and families impacted by mental illness ✨ Support mental hea
 lth services\, education\, and advocacy in our community ✨ Connect with 
 caring people who believe that mental health matters for everyone Whether 
 you walk to honor a loved one\, celebrate your own journey\, or stand up f
 or better access to mental health care — every step helps make a differe
