 apa in Napa\, CA\n\n- 40\\+ local makers\n\n- Handmade jewelry\, pottery\,
  fragrances\, candles\, bath and body\, apparel\, leather goods\, and more
 !\n\n- Kid- and pet-friendly\n\n- Enjoy live music by local musicians\n\n-
  Stop into the Makers Market™ brick-and-mortar store \\(in Suite 301\, a
 djacent to the fair\\) and shop even more unique\, American-made products.
 \n\nShare with your shopping buddies and mark your calendars! Can't wait t
 o see you there!\n\n- - -\n\nAre you a maker looking to sell your products
  at the Local Artist Street Fair? Register here:\n\nhttps://makersmarket.u
 s/maker-registration/\n\n- - -\n\nMakers Market is locally founded and ind
 ependently owned\, with brick-and-mortar stores in Alpharetta\, Napa\, San
 tana Row\, Lafayette\, and Mill Valley. We aim to bring you products that 
 honor the ideals of American craftsmanship and are modern\, handmade\, and
  sustainably produced. Join us in our mission of Rebuilding the Legacy of 
 American Made\, while supporting our local artists\, local economies\, and
  the community. Come visit one of our stores today!\n\nhttps://makersmarke
 t.us/locations/
LOCATION:First Street Napa
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1770863670938322/
